<body>
  <%- include('./partials/nav') %>
  <div class="container-fluid p-3 info-container">
    <div class="intro">
      <h1 class="text-center">Tabletop RPG Tools And Products</h1>
      <p>
        Start on the product page that matches the job you need to do: fast VTT sessions, persistent campaigns in Wyrlds,
        online 5E character sheets, community asset packs, SRD lookup, or synced tabletop music.
      </p>
      <small>
        <a href="/what-is-frc">What Is Far Reach Co?</a>
        |
        <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>
      </small>
      <hr>
    </div>

    <div class="quick-links" aria-label="Page sections">
      <a href="#product-pages">Product Pages</a>
      <a href="#vtt">Virtual Tabletop</a>
      <a href="#campaigns">Wyrlds</a>
      <a href="#sheets">Character Sheets</a>
      <a href="#library">Library Packs</a>
      <a href="#radio">Tabletop Radio</a>
      <a href="#knowledge">SRD And Resources</a>
      <a href="#paths">Suggested Paths</a>
    </div>

    <section id="product-pages">
      <h2>Primary Product Pages</h2>
      <p>
        These are the main search-facing pages for the product stack. Each one is focused on a specific use case instead
        of trying to explain everything at once.
      </p>

      <article class="resource-article">
        <div class="resource-image">
          <img
            src="/assets/screen_shots/vtt-screenshot.png"
            alt="Virtual tabletop with map grid, tokens, and sidebar controls."
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="resource-content">
          <div class="inline-div">
            <h3>No-Signup Virtual Tabletop</h3>
            <p>For fast online sessions, invite-link joining, layered controls, pins, portals, templates, and live table control.</p>
          </div>
          <p>
            Primary page: <a href="/simple-virtual-tabletop-no-player-accounts">No-Signup Virtual Tabletop</a>.
            Support pages: <a href="/virtual-tabletop-for-dnd-5e">Virtual Tabletop for D&amp;D 5E</a>,
            <a href="/roll20-alternative">Roll20 Alternative</a>, and <a href="/vtt-guide">VTT Guide</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource-article">
        <div class="resource-image">
          <img
            src="/assets/screen_shots/character_sheet_adren.png"
            alt="D&D 5E character sheet with stats, attacks, and spells."
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="resource-content">
          <div class="inline-div">
            <h3>D&amp;D 5E Character Sheets</h3>
            <p>For players and DMs who want editable, campaign-ready 5E sheets without rigid builder workflows.</p>
          </div>
          <p>
            Primary page: <a href="/dnd-5e-character-sheets">Online D&amp;D 5E Character Sheets</a>.
            Support page: <a href="/character-sheet-guide">Character Sheet Guide</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource-article">
        <div class="resource-image">
          <img
            src="/assets/screen_shots/wyrld-dash-overview.png"
            alt="Wyrld dashboard overview with recent campaign tools and activity."
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="resource-content">
          <div class="inline-div">
            <h3>Wyrlds: Persistent Campaign Management</h3>
            <p>For invite-based campaign spaces, linked character sheets, shared records, calendars, roles, and optional public discovery.</p>
          </div>
          <p>
            Start with <a href="/wyrlds">Wyrlds</a> for campaign management, then use
            <a href="/public-wyrlds-guide">Public Wyrlds</a> or <a href="/play-dungeons-and-dragons-online">Play D&amp;D Online</a>
            if you want player discovery.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource-article">
        <div class="resource-image">
          <img
            src="/assets/screen_shots/library_screenshot.png"
            alt="Asset library with folders and image cards."
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="resource-content">
          <div class="inline-div">
            <h3>Community Library Packs</h3>
            <p>For asset prep, pack sharing, reusable map bundles, and creator-friendly VTT image workflows.</p>
          </div>
          <p>
            Primary page: <a href="/community-library-packs">Community VTT Asset Packs</a>.
            Support pages: <a href="/library-guide">Library Guide</a> and <a href="/library-packs-guide">Library Packs Guide</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource-article">
        <div class="resource-image">
          <img
            src="/assets/screen_shots/radio_host_control.png"
            alt="Radio host controls with playlist and listener link."
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="resource-content">
          <div class="inline-div">
            <h3>Far Reach Radio</h3>
            <p>For synced tabletop music, shared listener links, and a cleaner alternative to bot-driven audio setup.</p>
          </div>
          <p>
            Primary page: <a href="/radio">Tabletop RPG Music Streaming</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource-article">
        <div class="resource-image">
          <img
            src="/assets/landing/dice.svg"
            alt="D&D 5E SRD icon."
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="resource-content">
          <div class="inline-div">
            <h3>SRD, Tutorials, And Free Resources</h3>
            <p>For rules lookup, onboarding content, bot docs, and downloadable assets that support live play.</p>
          </div>
          <p>
            Start with <a href="/resources/srd">D&amp;D 5E SRD Compendium</a>,
            <a href="/resources/tutorials">Tutorials</a>, and <a href="/resources/free-assets">Free Assets</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
