    <section id="vtt">
      <h2>Virtual Tabletop</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Primary intent:</strong> no-signup VTT, fast online VTT, D&amp;D 5E virtual tabletop.</li>
        <li><strong>Main page:</strong> <a href="/simple-virtual-tabletop-no-player-accounts">No-Signup Virtual Tabletop</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Support cluster:</strong> <a href="/virtual-tabletop-for-dnd-5e">Virtual Tabletop for D&amp;D 5E</a> and <a href="/roll20-alternative">Roll20 Alternative</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage guide:</strong> <a href="/vtt-guide">VTT Guide</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="campaigns">
      <h2>Wyrlds</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Primary intent:</strong> persistent campaign management, online campaign hubs, shared tables, linked character sheets, and long-term campaign organization.</li>
        <li><strong>Main page:</strong> <a href="/wyrlds">Wyrlds</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Player-facing path:</strong> <a href="/play-dungeons-and-dragons-online">Play D&amp;D Online</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Campaign discovery path:</strong> <a href="/public-wyrlds-guide">Public Wyrlds</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Admin path:</strong> <a href="/public-wyrlds-admin-guide">Public Wyrlds Admin Guide</a> and <a href="/wyrld-permissions-guide">Wyrld Permissions Guide</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="sheets">
      <h2>D&amp;D 5E Character Sheets</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Primary intent:</strong> online 5E character sheets, editable 5E sheets, D&amp;D Beyond alternative for faster table play.</li>
        <li><strong>Main page:</strong> <a href="/dnd-5e-character-sheets">Online D&amp;D 5E Character Sheets</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Support page:</strong> <a href="/character-sheet-guide">Character Sheet Guide</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Connected products:</strong> <a href="/simple-virtual-tabletop-no-player-accounts">Virtual Tabletop</a> and <a href="/wyrlds">Wyrlds</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="library">
      <h2>Library Packs And Asset Prep</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Primary intent:</strong> VTT asset packs, community map bundles, reusable token and image libraries.</li>
        <li><strong>Main page:</strong> <a href="/community-library-packs">Community VTT Asset Packs</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Support pages:</strong> <a href="/library-guide">Library Guide</a> and <a href="/library-packs-guide">Library Packs Guide</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Connected products:</strong> <a href="/simple-virtual-tabletop-no-player-accounts">Virtual Tabletop</a> and <a href="/wyrlds">Wyrlds</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="radio">
      <h2>Tabletop Radio</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Primary intent:</strong> tabletop RPG music streaming, D&amp;D music online, Discord music bot alternative.</li>
        <li><strong>Main page:</strong> <a href="/radio">Far Reach Radio</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Connected products:</strong> pair it with <a href="/simple-virtual-tabletop-no-player-accounts">Virtual Tabletop</a> sessions or <a href="/wyrlds">Wyrlds</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="knowledge">
      <h2>SRD And Resource Layer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Primary intent:</strong> D&amp;D 5E rules lookup, fast session reference, tutorial and onboarding support.</li>
        <li><strong>Main pages:</strong> <a href="/resources/srd">SRD Compendium</a>, <a href="/resources/tutorials">Tutorials</a>, and <a href="/resources/free-assets">Free Assets</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Connected products:</strong> link rules lookup and assets into your VTT, sheets, and Wyrlds.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="paths">
      <h2>Suggested Starting Paths</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Run a one-shot fast:</strong> open <a href="/simple-virtual-tabletop-no-player-accounts">No-Signup Virtual Tabletop</a>, then <a href="/vtt/guest/start">try the guest sandbox</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Build a persistent campaign:</strong> read <a href="/wyrlds">Wyrlds</a>, then connect play with <a href="/dnd-5e-character-sheets">5E Character Sheets</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Improve prep speed:</strong> start with <a href="/community-library-packs">Community Library Packs</a> and <a href="/resources/free-assets">Free Assets</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Add atmosphere:</strong> run <a href="/radio">Far Reach Radio</a> alongside your live table.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>
  <%- include('./partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>
